{"_note":"合并详情页(appstore-merged §6):任何 App 都有公开面;账号里的 App 多出经营 / 发版 / 质量 / 全部评论。生成器 gen_appstore.py。\n单个 App 的档案页 v2(路由 /app?appId=…&country=…),六段:①页头(这是谁)②Connect 联动行(仅「我的 App」)③指标网格 ④评分详情(四区 + 14 日走势)④b 用户评论(v40:星级分布 + 前 5 条 + 查看全部 → /reviews;v42 五条合一张分割线卡)⑤观察记录(版本/评分/里程碑事件流,本机攒的)+ 本次更新说明 + 商店资料 + 加卡。在这里把三张卡加到桌面 —— 参数(appId/country)由本页上下文确定。","type":"page","id":"appwatch-app","root":{"type":"container","id":"root","title":"${name}","layout":"list","direction":"vertical","gap":"10pt","_notePad":"左右内边距恒 **14pt**(page-design-system.md §5)。上下留白读 `@contentInset`(= @safeArea + 容器 chrome 占位 + 键盘),不是写死的 16pt —— 容器 chrome(standard 顶栏 + ‹返回)浮在内容之上(2026-08-08 实测撞到,两页同治)。⚠️ 也不能读 `@safeArea`:大屏浮层卡 safeArea 全 0。","padding":"14pt","paddingTop":"${@contentInset.top}pt","paddingBottom":"24pt","_note":"页面级 depends 三条并列:app.df(单 App 快照 + 观察表)+ regions.df(四区对比,输出键 rg* 与主流无冲突)+ reviews.df。appId / country / bundleId / r1..r4 来自路由 query(routeParams,§7.2 最低优先级);只带 bundleId 进来时由流反查,app.df 把解析后的 appId / country 透出,页内链接照常引用。","depends":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-app.df]","params":{"id":"${appId}","b":"${bundleId}","n":"","_cache":1},"_note":"私有面排在前(重名键公开侧胜出)。它先确认这个 App 在不在你账号里,不在就不再发请求。"},{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/app.df]","params":{"appId":"${appId}","bundleId":"${bundleId}","country":"${country}","_cache":1,"w":"${@window.width}"},"_note":"\n`_cache:1` = 开首屏缓存(§5.5 / G23)。**开关默认关** —— 这条 `.df` 同时被 `.xwidget` 消费,卡片那边不传这个键,于是永远真取数。"},{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/regions.df]","params":{"appId":"${appId}","bundleId":"${bundleId}","country":"${country}","r1":"${r1}","r2":"${r2}","r3":"${r3}","r4":"${r4}","_cache":1},"_note":"四个地区来自 query(从分区评分组件点进来时带着),缺省按 cnd:海外 US/GB/JP/DE、国内 CN/US/JP/GB。revalidate 只接主流的 _stale,本流旧货靠下拉/TTL 兜。"},{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/reviews.df]","params":{"appId":"${appId}","bundleId":"${bundleId}","country":"${country}","_cache":1,"w":"${@window.width}"},"_note":"v40 第三条:用户评论(星级分布 + 前 5 条)。输出键 rvList/rvN/dist/rvAvg/rvAt/distH/moreN 与 rv_stale/rvkey,与前两条无冲突;它的 stale 由评论页自己校新,详情页 onLoad 仍只接主流。"}],"_note2":"⚠️ 这里**不能**写 `params: {appId: …}` 当首帧兜底 —— §6.1 合成顺序是「继承 + 本节点显式 params(覆盖继承) + depends 输出」,路由 query 属最低优先级 ambient scope,写了兜底就等于把每次点进来的那个 App 顶掉(2026-08-08 实测:点 Instagram 进来渲的是 WhatsApp,且不报错)。query 真丢了就渲 `--`,那是诚实的空态。","items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"head","h":"92pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-head.rcn]"}},{"_note":"标成「我的」但还没接入(或这把密钥看不到它):一行接入引导。已接入且确认在账号里 → 下面整段私有面。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${mine},0),1),if::(eq::(${ok},1),0,1),0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"connect","h":"56pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-connect-app.rcn]"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/connect"}}]},{"_note":"私有面四段(经营 / 发版 / 质量 / 用户声音),只在确认是账号里的 App 时出现。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"secBiz","h":"26pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-sec-biz.rcn]"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/sales?id=${aid}"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"cbiz","h":"146pt","events":{"onClick":{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-open-sales.af]","params":{"bid":"${aid}"}}},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-c-biz.rcn]","depends":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-abiz.df]","params":{"id":"${aid}"}}]},"_note":"经营块 = 自己取数的画布叶子(appstore-merged §13):逐天日报冷启动慢,挂在页面根上会把整页拖进 15s 超时;放在叶子里只影响这一块(失败 / 加载态都在这一格里)。高度固定,非正常态的引导也画在这一块里。"},{"type":"Canvas","id":"secRel","h":"26pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-sec-rel.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"chero","h":"118pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-c-hero.rcn]"}},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bDen},0),1),0,1)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"ctf","h":"80pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-c-tf.rcn]"},"_note":"TestFlight:测试员 · 近 7 天新反馈 · 反馈总数(截图链接是临时的,只给数)。"},{"type":"Canvas","id":"secBuilds","h":"26pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-sec-builds.rcn]"}},{"op":"forEach","props":{"items":"${blist}","key":"bb","index":"i"},"items":[{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(lt::(${i},${bn}),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"b-${i}","h":"44pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-c-brow.rcn]"},"params":{"v":"${bb.v}","step":"${bb.step}","ago":"${bb.ago}","g":"${bb.g}","gw":"${bb.gw}"}}]}],"_note":"最近 6 个构建 + 与上一次的间隔条 = 原 rhythm 组件(发版节奏)搬进详情页。按 bn 截断。"}]},{"_note":"这把密钥看不到构建 / TestFlight(销售权限):一行说明 + 去设置换密钥,不画「测试员 0」。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bDen},0),1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"noBuild","h":"56pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-nobuild.rcn]"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/settings"}}]},{"type":"Canvas","id":"secQ","h":"26pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-sec-q.rcn]"}},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${pfVer}),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"cq","h":"138pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-c-quality.rcn]"}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${pfVer}),0),0,1)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"noPerf","h":"44pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-noperf.rcn]"}}]},{"_note":"没有诊断数据就整段不画(2026-09-26):一个标题配一行「还没有诊断数据」是纯噪音,大多数 App 常年如此。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${dgN},0),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"secDiag","h":"26pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-sec-diag.rcn]"}},{"op":"forEach","props":{"items":"${dgl}","key":"dd","index":"i"},"items":[{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(lt::(${i},${dgN}),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"dg-${i}","h":"52pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-c-dg.rcn]"},"params":{"t":"${dd.t}","s":"${dd.s}","w":"${dd.w}"}}]}]}]},{"type":"Canvas","id":"secVoice","h":"26pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-sec-voice.rcn]"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/reviews?appId=${aid}&country="}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"cvoice","h":"80pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-c-voice.rcn]"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/reviews?appId=${aid}&country="}},{"_note":"有评论才画 —— 空着一整块「最新评论」比不画更像坏了。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${rvTitle}),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"creview","h":"118pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-c-review.rcn]"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/reviews?appId=${aid}&country="}}]}]},{"type":"Canvas","id":"metrics","h":"132pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-metrics.rcn]"}},{"_note":"v42:「本次更新」标题移到卡外,与其他段同式(段标题高 40 = 段前 22 + 文字 + 8)。","type":"Canvas","id":"secNotes","h":"40pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-sec-notes.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","_note":"v40:高由 app.df 估的 notesH 给(按字数与换行折行),一行说明不再拖着 90pt 白板。","id":"notes","h":"${notesH}pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-notes.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"secRate","h":"40pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-sec-rate.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","_note":"v40:高由 app.df 的 rateH 二选一(有走势 196 / 无走势 140)。","id":"ratingCard","h":"${rateH}pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-rating.rcn]"}},{"_note":"公开评论:账号里的 App 改看上面的 ASC 评论(全地区 + 回复状态),这里不重复。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),0,1)]"},"items":[{"_note":"v40 用户评论段:标题行整行可点 → 评论页(带当前 appId/country,评论按 storefront 分区)。","type":"Canvas","id":"secRev","h":"40pt","events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/reviews?appId=${appId}&country=${country}"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-sec-rev.rcn]"}},{"_note":"星级分布(最新 ≤50 条),高由数据层 distH 二选一(150 / 空态 64)。","type":"Canvas","id":"revDist","h":"${distH}pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-rev-dist.rcn]"}},{"_note":"v42:前 5 条评论合成一张卡(行间 inset 分割线,超过 5 条时底部带「查看全部」行),整卡可点 → 评论页。高 revH5 由数据层算;rvN=0 不渲(分布卡已给空态)。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${rvN},0),1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"revList","h":"${revH5}pt","params":{"g":"0","lim":"5","more":"${moreN}"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/reviews?appId=${appId}&country=${country}"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-rev-list.rcn]"}}]}]},{"type":"Canvas","id":"secObs","h":"40pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-sec-obs.rcn]"}},{"_note":"观察记录卡:高度由数据层算(evH = 24+evN*44,空表 64)—— `${evH}pt` 动态高是 pill 首页的既有手法。","type":"Canvas","id":"obs","h":"${evH}pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-obs.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"secStore","h":"40pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-sec-store.rcn]"}},{"_note":"截图三格:每格独立节点、真比例(shotW/shotH 由 app.df 按 ${@window.width} 算,1:2.166),逐格可点 → 外链单页壳看原图。⚠️ onClick 串以字面 https:// 开头 + 尾巴模板 —— nav 分类跑在 ${} 插值之前,纯模板串会被判成 flow 静默吞掉(2026-09-02 真机抓到)。没有截图的格子整个不渲(op:if 按尾巴判)。","type":"container","id":"shots","layout":"flex","direction":"horizontal","gap":"8pt","h":"${shotH}pt","items":[{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${s1t}),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"shot1","w":"${shotW}pt","h":"${shotH}pt","params":{"u":"${s1}"},"events":{"onClick":"https://${s1t}"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-shot.rcn]"}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${s2t}),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"shot2","w":"${shotW}pt","h":"${shotH}pt","params":{"u":"${s2}"},"events":{"onClick":"https://${s2t}"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-shot.rcn]"}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${s3t}),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"shot3","w":"${shotW}pt","h":"${shotH}pt","params":{"u":"${s3}"},"events":{"onClick":"https://${s3t}"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-shot.rcn]"}}]}]},{"_note":"商店文字卡(截图已拆上行):整卡可点 → App Store 页(外链单页壳)。","type":"Canvas","id":"store","h":"104pt","events":{"onClick":"https://${storeTail}"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/d-store.rcn]"}},{"_note":"加卡入口 = **一个按钮**(§8.1a)。三张卡都吃这个 App 的 appId,故候选逐项带参数。","type":"Canvas","id":"addBtn","h":"56pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-addbtn.rcn]"},"events":{"onClick":{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/pick-app.af]","params":{"appId":"${appId}","country":"${country}","mine":"${mine}","ok":"${ok}"}}}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"foot","h":"74pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-foot.rcn]"}}],"events":{"_note":"同首页:两条 G23 流各自校新;下拉删两边缓存;凭证态自愈。","onLoad":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/revalidate.af]","params":{"stale":"${_stale}","ckey":"${ckey}"}},{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-app-revalidate.af]","params":{"stale":"${m_stale}","ckey":"${mckey}"}}],"onRefresh":"@[file://page/flow/refresh-app.af]","onVisible":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-cred-recheck.af]","params":{"cs":"${csB}"}}]}}}
